  "_comment": "GST Unit Quantity Codes. The e-invoice schema's ItemList[].Unit and GSTR-1's HSN summary both accept ONLY these codes - a unit spelled 'Kilogram' is rejected where 'KGS' is required (NIC error 2177). Posnic stores units as free text ('pcs', 'Kilogram', 'set'), so this file is the bridge. Verify against the portal's master codes (https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/Others/MasterCodes) before relying on it for a filing; codes are added rarely but they are added.",
  "_aliases_note": "aliases map what a shop actually typed to a code. Deliberately incomplete: a unit nobody can map with certainty is left out so the readiness check asks the shop, rather than filing a guess. 'OTH' exists for genuinely uncodeable units, but choosing it is the shop's decision, not ours - see EI-105 in INDIA_EINVOICING_DESIGN.md.",
